  <div class="note-content">
    <h1>📍 about me</h1>

    <p>spent 5 years catching money launderers. taught myself SEO. turns out I'm better at this.</p>

    <p>now I'm director of SEO at <a href="https://userp.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">uSERP</a>, a link building and SEO agency – running a ~$1M B2B client portfolio. I've grown organic traffic 300%+ for companies like <a href="https://joinblink.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Blink</a>, <a href="https://onboardmeetings.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OnBoard</a>, and <a href="https://www.formhealth.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Form Health</a>.</p>

    <p>miami kid, based in málaga. when I'm not in search console I'm dancing salsa or building things with <a href="/builds">claude code</a>.</p>

    <h2>the path here</h2>

    <p>five years at the miami agency of peru's largest bank – BCP, $39B in assets – catching fraud patterns in international transactions. won employee of the year in 2015. thought compliance was the rest of my life.</p>

    <p>then I quit, sold everything, and left miami to backpack through asia and europe. taught myself SEO in montenegro by building an affiliate site about luggage. it hit 2M impressions and I was hooked.</p>

    <p>first agency gig at organic growth marketing in 2018, working on <a href="https://www.bigcommerce.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bigcommerce</a> pre-IPO (biggest first-day pop of 2020). then six years at wired rhino – grew chamberofcommerce.org 363%, which taught me what link building looks like at scale.</p>

    <p>made director at <a href="https://seeker.digital/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">seeker digital</a>. ran SEO for <a href="https://orcascan.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">orca scan</a> (50,000+ orgs on their barcode platform). now at uSERP.</p>

    <h2>proof it works</h2>

    <p>blink: 92% google AI mode visibility, 10 #1 positions. onboard: #1 for "meeting minutes software" and "board portal." chamber of commerce: +$429K estimated site value. form health: 24K → 94K organic in under a year. <a href="/case-studies">case studies →</a></p>

    <h2>side quests</h2>

    <p>built <a href="https://www.instagram.com/thepassportabuser/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the passport memorandum</a> and turned it into $20K of sponsored travel. grew travel bag experts to 2M annual impressions before I ever worked at an agency.</p>

    <h2>currently into</h2>

    <p>building tools with <a href="/builds">claude code</a>. 45 systems so far – 9 custom MCP servers, multi-agent research orchestrators, GEO optimization tools. I don't really separate "doing SEO" from "building the tools to do it" anymore.</p>

